<article class="env-lemma" id="089W">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/089W">Lemma <span data-tag="089W">30.2.4</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be an affine morphism of schemes. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a quasi-coherent $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module. Then $H^ i(X, \mathcal{F}) = H^ i(S, f_*\mathcal{F})$ for all $i \geq 0$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/01XC" data-tag="01XC">30.2.3</a> and the Leray spectral sequence. See Cohomology, Lemma <a href="/tag/01F4" data-tag="01F4">20.13.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>